OL,3,GNEWSALifeboats helped anti-migrant
OL,4,Aprotesters, RNLI says
OL,5,
OL,6,FLifeboat crews helped to ensure the
OL,7,Fsafety of anti-migrant protesters in
OL,8,Fthe sea off Portsmouth, the RNLI has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FOn Sunday, demonstrators blocked roads
OL,12,Fto try to stop 120 cross-Channel
OL,13,Fmigrants who were brought ashore at
OL,14,FEastney with the RNLI's assistance.
OL,16,FIn an email to volunteers, RNLI chief
OL,17,Fexecutive Peter Sparkes said many
OL,18,Fprotesters were in or near the water
OL,19,Fand four lifeboats stood by for their
OL,20,Fsafety.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
